   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The modal verb sollen and its softer form",
     "texto": [
      "With **sollen** (to be supposed to) we give an instruction or task: **Du sollst im Bett bleiben** (you have to stay in bed).",
      "To give a gentler, more careful piece of advice, German uses the subjunctive **sollte**: **Du solltest dich ausruhen** (you should rest); **Sie sollten weniger arbeiten** (you should work less).",
      "In both cases, the main verb moves to the end of the sentence in the **infinitive**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
